    "name": "How Old is James?",
    "steam_appid": 2755820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/b371955a6131d72fba597a5812b33d52.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/c74c31ff6ee84366fb06e5fb32eff904.poster.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/c74c31ff6ee84366fb06e5fb32eff904.webm?t=1749193549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles utilising space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play by interacting with different layers of consciousness. Each layer consists of several segments. Segments stack on top of each other. You can separate them under specific circumstances. Rotate them to create new neural pathways. It becomes even more mind-boggling in the late game. This is when layers start severely affecting each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/cda7e628f8f4b8d2c1690366585a9f9c.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/7466ca9a4cafd0516d2894627f3f4f7b.poster.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/7466ca9a4cafd0516d2894627f3f4f7b.webm?t=1749193549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op all the way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to be played as a local co-op or single-player experience, from start to finish. Play how you like, when you like, with whom you like. The game's themes will inspire conversations. Gameplay will spark debates. The best part is that you can start alone, invite a friend when it gets complicated, and later continue on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/7d00629468d3f581bd37618c65570a7f.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/8bd0ec4de0c80bf2ce8136033ea9fd2e.poster.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/8bd0ec4de0c80bf2ce8136033ea9fd2e.webm?t=1749193549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinity space effect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human consciousness does not conform to physical restrictions. As space and time are made-up constructs, we move through them completely freely. Memories live on different layers of consciousness. They are placed inside one another infinitely many times. When transitioning through them, the camera enters layers within layers within layers\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/4b1363f5bb1f6e0f614f5ec1e80c1076.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multi-dimensional side scrolling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The agents can move in a 2D area. Once you get to a corner, the frame of reference rotates towards the next side. The game has simple movement mechanics. The fog and rotations create a stunning sense of space. The combination creates an awesome experience. Awaken sentience with cognition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UI as a futuristic operating system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main menu of the game is an in-game desktop operating system, set in the year 2095. It allows you to explore the narrative interestingly and unusually. The OS serves as the main hub for gathering information about the plot and lore of the game. Awaken consciousness with memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/df95af159d36ce5ff6b025aed650837a.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/9bc3887cddbfc1ea53619a3ba5aa77c5.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They move different</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play with the three interacting agents in the psychic apparatus. Each has its own unique movement mechanics and capabilities. Play with any one of them. Combine their abilities to progress through cognitive training. EGO double-jumps and clings onto walls. ID slingshots through the corridors. SUPEREGO manipulates gravity. The game is built with advanced custom physics to make it extra smooth and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/9ed813eca15d2a3488742d29a4e76a95.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People tend to forget the true value and meaning of their existence \u2014 its expiration date. It's the busy day-to-day life we lead. The game asks a profound question \u2014 what does it even mean to be human? It takes you to the roots of your humanity. It accomplishes this with a set of complex puzzles and an intricate storyline. What's required to constitute your existence? Is a set of memories and behaviours enough, or does it require a body of flesh and meat, and if so \u2014 to what extent?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/b371955a6131d72fba597a5812b33d52.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/c74c31ff6ee84366fb06e5fb32eff904.poster.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/c74c31ff6ee84366fb06e5fb32eff904.webm?t=1749193549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles utilising space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play by interacting with different layers of consciousness. Each layer consists of several segments. Segments stack on top of each other. You can separate them under specific circumstances. Rotate them to create new neural pathways. It becomes even more mind-boggling in the late game. This is when layers start severely affecting each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/cda7e628f8f4b8d2c1690366585a9f9c.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/7466ca9a4cafd0516d2894627f3f4f7b.poster.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/7466ca9a4cafd0516d2894627f3f4f7b.webm?t=1749193549\" type=\"video/webm; co