/span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multi-dimensional side scrolling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The agents can move in a 2D area. Once you get to a corner, the frame of reference rotates towards the next side. The game has simple movement mechanics. The fog and rotations create a stunning sense of space. The combination creates an awesome experience. Awaken sentience with cognition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UI as a futuristic operating system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main menu of the game is an in-game desktop operating system, set in the year 2095. It allows you to explore the narrative interestingly and unusually. The OS serves as the main hub for gathering information about the plot and lore of the game. Awaken consciousness with memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/df95af159d36ce5ff6b025aed650837a.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/9bc3887cddbfc1ea53619a3ba5aa77c5.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They move different</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play with the three interacting agents in the psychic apparatus. Each has its own unique movement mechanics and capabilities. Play with any one of them. Combine their abilities to progress through cognitive training. EGO double-jumps and clings onto walls. ID slingshots through the corridors. SUPEREGO manipulates gravity. The game is built with advanced custom physics to make it extra smooth and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755820/extras/9ed813eca15d2a3488742d29a4e76a95.avif?t=1749193549\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People tend to forget the true value and meaning of their existence \u2014 its expiration date. It's the busy day-to-day life we lead. The game asks a profound question \u2014 what does it even mean to be human? It takes you to the roots of your humanity. It accomplishes this with a set of complex puzzles and an intricate storyline. What's required to constitute your existence? Is a set of memories and behaviours enough, or does it require a body of flesh and meat, and if so \u2014 to what extent?</p>",
